						<div class='flex_column av_one_fourth  first el_before_av_one_fourth'><section id="text-5" class="widget clearfix widget_text"><h3 class="widgettitle">Company</h3>			<div class="textwidget"><p>Agricpays Tanzania is an Agriculture Company that focuses on creating solutions to long-lasting problems facing smallholder farmers in rural areas through transforming farmer’s mindsets. We stand on a new belief that “Agriculture Pays” only if smallholder farmers change their mindsets from “Subsistence Farming” to “Farming as a business” mentality.</p>
</div>
